```=data
wiki (dump storage) | https://shiza.sccl.cc | s!/#tpost territory
scclNix | https://codeberg.org/scclie/sccl_nix/ | modular host-profile NixOS architecture
notizine | https://notizine.sccl.cc/ | minimal modular Zine-based toolkit for multilingual static sites
gif.sccl.cc | https://gif.sccl.cc/ | minimal client-side no tracking fast GIF maker
otp-migrate.sccl.cc | https://otp-migrate.sccl.cc/ | client-side Google Authenticator OTP migration decoder
xkb.sccl.cc | https://xkb.sccl.cc | linux X keyboard layout generator
heatkeys.sccl.cc | https://heatkeys.sccl.cc | keyboard layout heatmap
bip39_vanity_rs | https://github.com/scclie/bip39_vanity_rs | BIP39 vanity address generator on rust (BTC, LTC, ETH/EVM, TON...)
rulemak-CAWS | http://shiza.sccl.cc/en/Peripheral/Keyboards/Rulemak-CAWS | russian phonetically equivalent variant of Colemak CAWS layout
sakuli60lp | http://shiza.sccl.cc/en/Peripheral/Keyboards/Sakuli60lp | handwired Wireless Hotswap Split Choc Low Profile Open Source Keyboard
